%e A401999 For n = 13, the quasi-polyomino with binary code A401998(13) = 25 is {(0,0),(2,0),(1,1)}. For k = 5, only the I-, L-, N-, V-, W-, and Z-pentominoes have no copy of this quasi-polyomino in any position or orientation, so T(13,5) = 6.
%Y A401999 Rows include A401400 (n=12), A402001 (n=13), A401401 (n=14), A402002 (n=15), A401402 (n=16), A402003 (n=18 and n=20), A401403 (n=36).
